 "validation_plan": "Run the next 1–3 iterations with the new weight and compare performance best and mean to the current values (best=0.00045, mean=0.000305). Success for the validator is any demonstrable increase in best performance or a clear upward trend in mean performance versus the current accepted state. If performance remains flat, pursue implementation checks of the performance scorer.",
